# What the platform image's build context leaves out (Dockerfile). A developer's own web/node_modules would replace the one `npm ci` makes in the image (and hold another platform's native binaries), and
# a local web/dist or test result is not the build's. CI builds from a clean checkout, where none of this exists; the entries keep a local build the same build.
.git
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/test-results
**/node_modules
